    "linkedin:d2e326b6c0176b31668abfab": {
      "job": {
        "title": "Frontend Engineer, Jr. (React.js, CSS)",
        "company": "Sundayy",
        "location": "",
        "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4469122950",
        "platform": "Linkedin",
        "date_posted": "",
        "is_remote": false,
        "description": "**About The Company**\n Pixibo has established itself as a category leader in Asia, serving prestigious clients across Southeast Asia and Europe. Our client portfolio includes renowned brands such as Zalora in Singapore, FashionValet in Malaysia, MAP in Indonesia, and Shinsegae in South Korea. We specialize in developing innovative solutions that enhance the online shopping experience, with our flagship product, Find Your Fit, transforming traditional size charts into personalized, real\\-time size and fit advice for consumers. Our technology helps leading online fashion retailers significantly improve conversion rates, increase average order values, and reduce return rates. Additionally, we are pioneering in\\-store contactless sizing solutions to meet the evolving needs of shoppers in a post\\-Covid world. At Pixibo, we foster a quirky, diverse, and challenge\\-driven culture where collaboration across departments and borders is essential. Our team is passionate about creating impactful products that matter and delight our customers.\n   \n\n  \n\n**About The Role**\n We are seeking a motivated Junior Developer with approximately 1\\+ years of experience to join our dynamic team. In this role, you will be responsible for building and maintaining frontend websites, HTML widgets, and APIs that support our fast\\-paced, consumer\\-facing products. You will have the opportunity to work on exciting projects where rapid delivery and high\\-quality output are critical to success. The ideal candidate will be proficient in the TypeScript/Node/React ecosystem and familiar with AWS Cloud Platform. You will collaborate closely with cross\\-functional teams to deliver seamless, user\\-friendly interfaces and contribute to the continuous improvement of our products. This role offers a unique chance to grow your skills in a challenging environment while contributing to innovative solutions that impact thousands of online shoppers worldwide.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Qualifications**\n* Degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field, or equivalent professional experience\n* At least 1\\+ years of experience in web development\n* Proficiency in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and React (or React Native)\n* Experience with flux/redux for state management\n* Knowledge of REST API integration\n* Familiarity with deployment platforms such as Heroku\n* Version control experience with Git\n* Understanding of OAuth for authentication processes\n* Optional: Basic knowledge of Android Native or iOS development\n* Optional: Experience with AWS Cloud Platform\n* Excellent written and verbal communication skills\n* Strong ability to collaborate effectively with customers and team members\n\n\n**Responsibilities**\n* Develop and maintain responsive, user\\-friendly frontend websites and widgets\n* Build and integrate APIs to support product functionalities\n* Collaborate with cross\\-functional teams including designers, backend developers, and product managers to deliver high\\-quality solutions\n* Participate in code reviews, testing, and debugging to ensure optimal performance and security\n* Contribute to the continuous improvement of development processes and tools\n* Assist in deploying applications on cloud platforms like AWS and Heroku\n* Stay updated with the latest web development trends and technologies\n\n\n**Benefits**\n* Interesting and challenging work within a forward\\-thinking company\n* Inclusive and friendly company culture that values diversity\n* Generous vacation policy to support work\\-life balance\n* Light\\-filled, dog\\-friendly, and human\\-friendly office environment\n* Regular team\\-building events and activities\n\n\n Equal Opportunity\n   \n\n  \n\n Pixibo is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. We do not discriminate based on race, religion, gender, sexual orientation, age, disability, or any other protected status. We believe that a diverse team fosters innovation and drives success, and we welcome applicants from all backgrounds to apply.",
